# Agent Instructions

Before starting development work, check and use relevant Superpowers skills.

At the start of any coding task, prefer using:
- using-superpowers
- brainstorming, when requirements are unclear or design choices matter
- writing-plans, when implementation spans multiple steps
- test-driven-development, when changing behavior
- systematic-debugging, when fixing bugs
- verification-before-completion, before declaring work complete

User instructions always take precedence.
